# The repository ignores every *.vcf, *.vcf.gz, *.tbi and case.yaml so that patient
# data can never be committed. This directory holds the one exception: a hand-written
# VCF of public ClinVar/dbSNP alleles and a case file for a proband that does not
# exist (README.md). Re-include exactly those four files, nothing else: the leading
# "/" anchors each pattern to this directory, so a VCF or case file in any
# subdirectory (a run directory someone pointed here, say) stays ignored.
!/public.vcf
!/public.vcf.gz
!/public.vcf.gz.tbi
!/case.yaml
